<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθεράπ-ευτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uncared for</i>, of things,
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				2.4.3
			</span></i>; of persons, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.22
			</span></i>; of faults, <i>neglected, not treated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Lib.</u>
				p.39
			</span></i> O.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ.</span>
			<i>neglect of one's personal appearance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Pisc.</u>
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>incurable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGnom.</u>
					205
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>, in form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀθαράπ-</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ocyp.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, [<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
			</span></i>]<i><span class="en">
				14.689
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταραχή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>D.</u>
					1.15
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.404
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>not prepared</i> or <i>cured</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέαρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.76.16
				</span></i>
			.</div>
